  <item>
    <title>电影“鬼魅浮生”-家与空间对于我们的意义</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6637544c03bcdd73a9909054</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6637544c03bcdd73a9909054</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 05 May 2024 09:41:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>上周五该更新的时候大熊安琳跟舞蹈跑去海边拍蓝眼泪（Bioluminescence）了，结果蓝眼泪没拍到节目上线时间还错过了，你看看大熊是多么的不靠谱</span></strong><span>😂。</span><strong><span>下不为例，争取不鸽</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>这期是属于我们“嘉宾推荐个人喜爱的小众电影”单元，来自樟羊推荐的</span><strong><span>A Ghost Story (鬼魅浮生) 2017</span></strong><span> R ‧ Fantasy/Romance ‧ 1h 32m</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们分析了这部低成本的优秀作品的优缺点，探讨了东方与西方对于死后世界的想象、家与空间对于我们的意义，以及执念与我们的关系。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>大熊安琳</span></p><span></span><p><span>叔同</span></p><span></span><p><span>舞蹈</span></p><span></span><p><span>樟羊</span></p><span></span><p><span>“盐酥电影” 节目每周五晚上六点更新（我尽量）</span></p><span></span><p><span>同时上线：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙</span></p><span></span><p><span>Apple Podcast</span></p><span></span><p><span>Spotify</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：塞瑟岛</span></p>]]></description>
